        "variant": "wo002-play-hub",
        "html": "\n<div class=\"wo002-play-page\" data-companion-context=\"play\" data-companion-copy=\"Choose from the real catalog. Only the Wicked Bites staging preview opens in the website player.\" data-progression-page=\"play-summary\">\n  <section class=\"wo002-play-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"play-title\">\n    <div class=\"wo002-play-hero__copy\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">TOADAL FEAST &middot; BROWSER GAMES</p><h1 id=\"play-title\">Play a little Feast.</h1>\n      <p>Explore four browser-game listings. One staging build opens in the website player; the CLAW candidate is held for origin-safety work, and two concepts have no playable website package.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--primary\" href=\"#browser-games\">Browse the games <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&darr;</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"wo002-play-proof\" aria-label=\"Play availability summary\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW ONLY</span><strong>1</strong><p>staging build open in player</p><small>CLAW is held pending origin-safe integration. No account or cross-device save is offered.</small></aside>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"wo002-game-library\" aria-labelledby=\"game-library-title\">\n    <header class=\"wo002-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">CHOOSE YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE</p><h2 id=\"game-library-title\">Browser games</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/\">Back to Home <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&larr;</span></a></header>\n    <div class=\"game-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter browser games\">\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-game-tab=\"all\">All games <span>4</span></button>\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-game-tab=\"preview\">Preview <span>4</span></button>\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-game-tab=\"public\">Public <span>0</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"game-empty\" data-game-empty hidden role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">No games are listed in this state yet.</p>\n    <div id=\"browser-games\" class=\"play-card-grid\">\n      <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"wicked-bites\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n        <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/wicked-bites/\" aria-label=\"View Wicked Bites game details\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/images/games/wicked-bites-v5.5-preview.webp\" alt=\"Wicked Bites 5.5 staging gameplay preview.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">STAGING BUILD &middot; 5.5</p>\n          <h3>Wicked Bites</h3><p>A compact, isolated browser preview from the Wicked Bites 5.5 staging build. The listing remains PREVIEW and is not a public release.</p>\n          <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/wicked-bites/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"claw-feed-gulper\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n        <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/claw-feed-gulper/\" aria-label=\"View CLAW: Feed Gulper game details\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/images/games/claw-feed-gulper-v2.5.1-preview.webp\" alt=\"CLAW: Feed Gulper 2.5.1 staging package screenshot; website launch remains held.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">STAGING CANDIDATE &middot; LAUNCH HELD &middot; 2.5.1</p>\n          <h3>CLAW: Feed Gulper</h3><p>A versioned staging package exists, but website launch is held: its save namespace and original broad service-worker cache behavior require origin-safe requalification.</p>\n          <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/claw-feed-gulper/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"toadal-tower-defense\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n        <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/toadal-tower-defense/\" aria-label=\"View TOADAL Tower Defense concept details\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/images/world/candy-kingdom.webp\" alt=\"Candy Kingdom world artwork, not game footage.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">CONCEPT PREVIEW</p>\n          <h3>TOADAL Tower Defense</h3><p>A preview concept only. No runnable browser package is connected, and the shared world artwork is not gameplay footage.</p>\n          <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/toadal-tower-defense/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"froggy-fruity-bash\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n        <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/froggy-fruity-bash/\" aria-label=\"View Froggy Fruity Bash concept details\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/images/characters/genie-fruity.webp\" alt=\"Fruity Genie character artwork, not game footage.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">CONCEPT PREVIEW</p>\n          <h3>Froggy Fruity Bash</h3><p>A preview concept only. No runnable browser package is connected, and the character artwork is not gameplay footage.</p>\n          <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/froggy-fruity-bash/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"wo002-detail-facts play-journey-grid\" aria-label=\"Challenges, rewards, scores, and the app\">\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"feast-pass-quests\" data-companion-copy=\"Website quests count only activities with a configured local event source.\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">CHALLENGES</p><h2>Website quest board</h2>\n      <p>The quest board reflects configured website activities. No Wicked Bites completion challenge is active, so opening or scoring a preview does not advance a game quest.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/feast-pass/quests/\">View quests and challenges <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"feast-pass-rewards\" data-companion-copy=\"Website milestones come from configured local activities; a score alone grants no reward.\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">BADGES &amp; REWARDS</p><h2>Website milestones</h2>\n      <p>Configured badges and milestones belong to browser-local website progression. A game score alone does not grant XP, Sparks, Treats, or an achievement.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/feast-pass/rewards/\">Explore rewards and collection <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"leaderboards\" data-companion-copy=\"Your browser records stay local. Connected rankings are not active.\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">LOCAL SCORES</p><h2>Your browser leaderboard</h2>\n      <p>Only completed Wicked Bites scores can enter the website score record when the local score bridge is connected.</p>\n      <p><strong>Personal best:</strong> <span data-play-local-best data-local-score-best data-game-id=\"wicked-bites\">No completed run recorded in this browser.</span></p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/leaderboards/\">Open Leaderboards <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"feast-pass\" data-companion-copy=\"Feast Pass shows guest-local website progress from this browser.\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">FEAST PASS</p><h2>Your browser journey</h2>\n      <p>Progress is local to this browser. View the configured level, XP, Sparks, Treats, quest activity, and collection state here.</p>\n      <dl class=\"progression-stat-grid\" aria-label=\"Guest-local Feast Pass summary\">\n        <div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Level</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"level\">&mdash;</dd></div>\n        <div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>XP</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"xp\">&mdash;</dd></div>\n        <div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Sparks</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"sparks\">&mdash;</dd></div>\n        <div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Treats</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"treats\">&mdash;</dd></div>\n      </dl>\n      <p class=\"progression-storage\" data-progression-storage-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Guest progress is stored only in this browser.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/feast-pass/\">Open Feast Pass <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"detail-fact\" data-companion-context=\"app\" data-companion-copy=\"The mobile app is the full adventure. Verified store destinations are not configured on this site.\" data-companion-reaction=\"present\">\n      <p class=\"section-kicker\">THE FULL ADVENTURE</p><h2>TOADAL FEAST app</h2>\n      <p>The mobile app is the flagship experience, separate from these browser listings. The App page shows real Arcade, Puzzle, and Feastfall gameplay; verified store destinations are not configured here.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/app/\">Explore the app <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n  <aside class=\"wo002-truth-note\"><strong>About these previews</strong><p>PREVIEW means a build is available for evaluation, not that it is a public release. Each detail page identifies whether a runnable website package is connected.</p></aside>\n  <aside class=\"toadal-companion\" data-companion data-zone=\"hero\" aria-label=\"Toadal contextual helper\"><div class=\"companion-panel\" id=\"toadal-companion-panel\" data-companion-panel><p class=\"companion-label\">TOADAL SAYS</p><p class=\"companion-message\" data-companion-speech aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">Choose from the real catalog. Only the Wicked Bites staging preview opens in the website player.</p></div><button class=\"companion-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-companion-toggle aria-controls=\"toadal-companion-panel\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Minimize Toadal helper\"><img class=\"companion-image\" data-companion-image src=\"/assets/images/characters/toadal-victory.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Minimize Toadal helper</span></button></aside>\n</div>"
